# Environment example — aziindrobeta

Copy to `.env.local` (do not commit secrets).

```bash
# Public site
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASEPATH=
# Canonical domain is defined in src/data/publication.js (https://aziindrobeta.ro)

# Google Search Console API (optional scripts)
GSC_SITE_URL=https://aziindrobeta.ro/
GSC_SITEMAP_URL=https://aziindrobeta.ro/sitemap-index.xml
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/absolute/path/to/service-account.json

# Do not put private keys in the repository.
```
